    "semantic_summary": "AssetExplorerWindow is a primary UI component responsible for rendering and managing the visual lifecycle of a dynamic editor window. It acts as a container, accepting inputs like title, icon, and footer content to construct a fully interactive element. It delegates global state management, such as focusing or closing, to the WindowService, while integrating directives for interactivity like movement and icon display."
